tion":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:4bd01a2e02865ba2085086e55b0b74409937efc10654af735d6d4f6fbc134fff","file":"preprints/Bose-Einstein-condensation-at-positive-temperature-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":41,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"14409a40dd98f569a0f0800e429ce86b3cc918daec91bcb989a863498cda7935","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Bose-Einstein-condensation-at-positive-temperature-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:4bd01a2e02865ba2085086e55b0b74409937efc10654af735d6d4f6fbc134fff","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Bose-Einstein-condensation-at-positive-temperature-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L41"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every $a>0$, there is $\\rho_*(a)>0$ such that for each fixed\n$0<\\rho<\\rho_*(a)$ there is a fixed temperature $T=T(a,\\rho)>0$ for which\n\\[\n \\liminf_{\\substack{L\\to\\infty\\\\N/L^3\\to\\rho}}\n \\frac{\\langle u_{0,L},\\gamma^{(1)}_{N,L,T}u_{0,L}\\rangle}{N}>0.\n\\]\nThe exclusion distance, density, and temperature are held fixed in this\nlimit."}
